#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-registry-add.md:42
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-registry-add.md:44
msgid ""
"This command adds an entry to the user registry that maps flake reference "
"_from-url_ to flake reference _to-url_. If an entry for _from-url_ already "
"exists, it is overwritten."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-registry-add.md:48
msgid ""
"Entries can be removed using [`nix registry remove`](./nix3-registry-remove."
"md)."
msgstr ""

